    <briefdescription>
<para>Loss distribution with Hull-White bucketing. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Loss distribution with Hull-White bucketing <verbatim> Loss distribution for varying volumes and probabilities of default, 
 independence assumed.

 The implementation of the loss distribution follows 

 John Hull and Alan White, &quot;Valuation of a CDO and nth to default CDS 
 without Monte Carlo simulation&quot;, Journal of Derivatives 12, 2, 2004. </verbatim> </para>    </detaileddescription>
